{%- comment -%}
  Brand marks for the footer, as solid glyphs that follow currentColor (Gemini keeps its own gradient).
  Accepts: icon: chatgpt | perplexity | google | claude | grok | instagram | linkedin | x | facebook | youtube

  ChatGPT (OpenAI), Perplexity, Google Gemini and Claude are the Simple Icons 14.0.0 paths (CC0), downloaded
  2026-11-22 with the user's approval. Simple Icons has no Grok mark, so the Grok slashed circle is drawn to match.
  The social marks follow the same Simple Icons shapes. Every mark belongs to its owner and is used only to link to
  that service.
{%- endcomment -%}
